  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.AbilityCleansingPalm": "<b>(Ability Gained: Cleansing Palm -</b> A ranged fighting technique of Jojo's order, allows you to blast your enemies with waves of pure spiritual energy, weakening them and hurting the corrupt.<b>)</b>"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.AskTeachMonkWays": "You ask Jojo if he can teach you how to fight like a monk.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.BowEarnedRest": "As you bow to Jojo he bows back and says, [say: Go get some rest [name], you've earned it.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.BreathingIsKey": "[say: Breathing is key.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.CampNightSounds": "The camp is alive with the sounds of voices on the wind, of the ominous sizzling of the great scar between worlds that is the portal that brought you here. You feel open to the universe as if it were a lady in a dress sitting next to you, that you could easily reach out and touch. You feel liberated and free despite the fact that you are not moving a muscle. You are ready for anything but expecting nothing. You are neither thinking nor dreaming, you simply are.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.CheerfulLetsBegin": "Jojo gives you a bright cheerful smile, [say: Alright [name]... let's begin.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.ContinueTrainingAgain": "You ask the monk to continue your training; but he shakes his head.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.ContinueTrainingRefused": "You ask the monk to continue your training; but he shakes his head.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.EnduranceSparring": "Largely due to your increased endurance and improved technique the two of you spend more time sparring and dancing through the forms Jojo knows. When it comes time for a brief lecture, Jojo pants as he sits with you, taking a minute to regain his breath. Jojo's lectures, instead of dealing with how to strike and defend oneself, deal with the nature of the soul. You learn much about individuality, willpower and determination and after the lecture the two of you meditate on what you've learned for a few silent moments.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.EnduranceTrainingShift": "Jojo switches up the way he is instructing you. Largely due to your increased endurance, the two of you spend more time moving through forms together and practicing strikes and maneuvers. When it comes time for a brief lecture, he breaks out one of the few scrolls he has from his order and tells you what he knows about the contents.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.FormsMockStrikes": "Before too long, the two of you are up again and practicing forms and mock strikes, even sparring briefly from time to time. By the end of the intense training session you are covered in sweat... but so is Jojo, and neither of you are out of breath. As you bow to Jojo he returns the gesture and says, [say: Go get some rest [name], you've earned it.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.IntenseSessionBreaks": "The entire session is intense, and each brief lecture or demonstration serves as a quick break to stop your body from giving out, and help you build endurance.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.JojoConsidersTraining": "Jojo considers you for a moment before saying, [say: Yes I can teach you the forms, skills and techniques I was taught by my order. Plus...] Jojo gazes off into the distance, his attention drifting for a moment before he continues, [say: since I am all that is left, it is up to me to bestow this knowledge upon a worthy soul.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.JojoFriendNotMaster": "Jojo smiles, [say: I am not a master, therefore I am unworthy of taking you on as a disciple... but as a friend I can teach you all I know. Whenever you are ready, just ask.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.JojoUnworthyMaster": "Jojo frowns, [say: I am willing to teach you [name], when I can. However I am no master, therefore I am unworthy of taking a disciple. But as your friend, I will teach you what I know so that you may protect yourself. I believe our time would be better spent meditating. There is very little you can do with these techniques without first finding your center.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.JojoWantsTeaching": "Jojo smiles, [say: In all honesty [name], I should be asking you to teach me, but I'll do my best.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.LearnedBreathControl": "Jojo's constantly repeated words resonate within you as you realize you've learned to control your breathing. It takes you less time to rest than normal and you feel as though you are bursting with energy because of it. Your [fullChest]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.MeditateAloneAfter": "As you finish training you decide to meditate alone; returning to your [bed], you close your eyes and begin to breathe. Then the world around you begins to sing.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.MeditateBeforeTraining": "[say: I fear that your time would be better spent meditating before we continue your training. Would you like to do so now?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.MovementsSinkIn": "The repeated movements are slowly starting to sink in, your muscles becoming accustomed to Jojo's training.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.NoLecturesExhausted": "There are no lectures. Neither you nor Jojo are masters, but as of right now, the two of you have exhausted the small store of knowledge available to you from the Celestial Lotus. You and Jojo instead practice to exhaustion, heaving and panting for breath, whilst still finding time to enjoy each others company.[pg]"
