  "Scenes.Jojoscene.ApparentlyJojoDOESlift.PerkEnlightenedMeditation": "<b>(Perk Gained: Enlightened -</b> White magic threshold increased. Meditation restores health. Grants the ability to meditate alone.<b>)</b>"
