  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoAppearance.LeanHonedMonkBody": "[pg]Despite his youthful face, Jojo's body is lean and honed from his many years as a monk. Concealing his firm build is a pale blue robe tied with a cloth sash, as well as somewhat baggy pants ending just above his [if (nofur) {feet|mouse-like footpaws}], all fitted yet loose enough to allow him to move freely. His other equipment consists of prayer beads around his neck and a polished wooden staff, which currently lies at his bedroll."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoAppearance.WhiteMouseAppearance": "Jojo is a white-[if (nofur) {{haired|furred}}] mouse-[if (nofur) {{boy|morph}}], standing at {0}[if (tallness > 54) {{merely }}][if (metric) {{121 centimeters|four feet}}] tall. The large, dish-like ears and ropy pink tail make immediate his racial heritage, not to mention the small[if (nofur) {{ button nose|, pink nose atop his rodent-like snout}}]. His face is light and devoid of blemishes, and with the snowy-white [if (nofur) {{skin|fur}}] across his body, his brown eyes are all that distinguish him from an albino."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoAtCampRape.ProactiveApproach": "[pg][say:It feels good to take a proactive approach to making this world safer,] he says, in a positive mood. [say:Although, perhaps you ask me along because you're feeling stir-crazy? Having companionship in the relative safety of the camp is nice, but it can feel restricting.]"
