  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.DazedCrazySmile": " with a dazed, crazy-looking smile"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.GoblinAnswersDoor": "Lynnette the goblin answers the door and lets you in, waving you deeper into her shop. Her shining black dress barely contains her fertile-hips and jiggling chest as she greets you, [say: Welcome back honey! Who's the cutie?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.GurgleDiscoversSize": "and releases a surprised gurgle when she discovers their size. Clearly all the trips to the milker have given Jojo an impressive set of testes."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.HisEnduranceEdge": " In no time flat he's reached the edge of his endurance.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.LynnettePants": "Lynnete pants"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.MoansReachesHair": "Jojo moans and reaches for Lynnette's hair, but you stop him with a sharp command. He's paying for your services today, not getting a reward. Big, lusty eyes look up at him from his loins, and he shudders, his heavy balls clenching and relaxing from the goblin's perfect throat-fuck. She reaches up to caress them, "
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.MostSwallowedFinish": ", readily swallowing most of it. After a short time, she pulls back and lets him finish by filling her mouth. In turn, she spits the sticky mess into a funnel that leads to who-knows-where."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.PetMousePaysToday": "You answer that your pet mouse Jojo will be taking care of payment for you today. Lynnette looks doubtful, but she quickly drops to her knees in front of the mouse, determined to get her payment one way or another. Jojo's forearm-length erection immediately makes itself apparent. The goblin matron coos at the sight, humming happily once she sees the rivulets of pre-cum streaming down your slut's cock. In one smooth motion, she devours the heavy mouse-shaft, sliding her lips down all the way to the base.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.RollsThemFingers": "and rolls them back and forth in her fingers, expertly pleasuring Jojo."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.SmilePhrase": " with a smile"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.SurprisedGurgleHeavy": "and releases a surprised gurgle when she feels just how heavy and full they've gotten. All that time at the milker has clearly done Jojo's body good, and Lynette is likely to leave with a mouse-milk mustache."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPaysForPerms.WetStainsBlouse": "Lynnette, for her part, has two wet stains on her blouse, but she ignores them as she gives the mouse's nuts a gentle squeeze. He cums easily and hard from that little bit of extra stimulation. The goblin's throat works to devour it all"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPredictsRape.CloseInOnMonk": "Without being too open about your intentions, you close in on the monk, but are met with the tip of his staff [if (metric) {centimeters|inches}] from your [face]."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPredictsRape.HopesToPurgeLust": "[pg]The monk thinks he can knock the corrupt lust out of you, but he can't hide his fear that you won't lose this time."
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoPredictsRape.SternSadExpression": "[pg]A stern and sad expression covers Jojo's face. [say:I wished to see the good in you, and save this world from another demon.] His grip readjusts, and his voice shakes with suppressed emotion. [say:That is one virtue I will [b:not] let you take from me.]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFactory.ControlsDestroyedReport": "His ears perk at the news as you continue, telling him that you destroyed the factory controls, which permanently shut down the factory - but released an enormous quantity of corrupted fluids into the environment.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFactory.DescribeFactoryWin": "You tell Jojo about your having successfully found and stopped the demonic factory. You tell him how you found out the factory was there and how you defeated the demons inside. He seems impressed.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFactory.FactoryShutdownReport": "His ears perk at the news as you continue, telling him that you shut down the factory and destroyed the controls, for the sake of the surrounding environment.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFactory.JojoCocksHead": "Jojo cocks his head to the side as he considers his words carefully before speaking, [say: I guess it seems like the right move. Permanently disabling the factory would not only deal a heavy blow to the demons, but also give the rest of us time to reclaim the forest... but I don't know. If the release of fluids was as much as you say it was then there's a chance that it'll do more harm than good. I've seen what corruption does to this world and that much corrupted fluid flooding out all at once could really hurt our cause. I'm not saying it was the wrong thing to do, or lessening your accomplishment, but you have to be careful. The demons aren't just powerful, they're deceptive.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFactory.JojoCounselPleased": "You listen to the monk's council and despite his concerns he seems genuinely happy to hear you've struck a blow against the demonic regime.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFactory.JojoSwellsPride": "Jojo's chest swells with pride as he looks at you with new eyes before saying, [say: Wow [name], I don't know what to say. I know it uprooted your life and took you away from the ones you love but I sincerely believe that the day you came through that portal was a good day for all of Mareth. I am proud of you and humbled by the fact that I can call you my friend.] He rises and gives you a hug of fierce devotion and friendly affection before pulling away and saying, [say: We'll have to watch the factory though... the demons can't be allowed to reopen that evil place.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFallOfTheMonks.AskJojoAboutMonks": "You decide to ask Jojo if he'd be willing to tell you exactly what happened to the monks of his order.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFallOfTheMonks.BrotherLograyDeath": "[say: Senior Brother Logray didn't hesitate - he leapt in front of me, staff twirling, shattering skulls and breaking limbs with each sweep. As he barred their path, he cried out to me to flee, to run for the safety of the village... and I did. Overwhelmed by the bitter-sweet stink of corruption wafting off the demons, I ran like a frightened little field mouse. I was a coward and I left my masters and all my friends to face the horde one mouse short.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFallOfTheMonks.JojoShameThenResolve": "You watch as Jojo bows his head in shame for a moment. Yet when he looks back up there's fire in his eyes.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFallOfTheMonks.JojoSpeaksDowncast": "Jojo speaks with eyes downcast and a voice soft as feathers landing on fallen soldiers, [say: Truthfully?... I don't know exactly how it happened... or why... but my order was wiped out. Though I've looked for my brothers and sisters of the Celestial Lotus ever since then, I'm the only survivor, as far as I can tell. You see the demons attacked the monastery while I was away with one of the senior brothers. I was a mere novice and he was one of the more fun teachers so we lost track of time. The sun was setting and we were halfway back to the monastery when we saw what we thought was a huge column of smoke rising from the central building. When we got closer we saw the cloud for what it truly was, a billowing tower of those imps. We were spotted and several of them came flying at us - they crossed the distance far faster than we could have.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFallOfTheMonks.PlayerComfortsJojo": "You try to comfort Jojo, telling him he couldn't have made a difference being but a single mouse, but he waves you off. He tells you he is fine and thanks you for your concern.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFallOfTheMonks.StoryStirsResolve": "You can tell the story has affected him, but you're surprised to hear the resolve in his voice and see the defiant strength in his eyes.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkFallOfTheMonks.VowOfResolve": "[say: Never again...][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.ArmAroundShoulders": "You slide an arm around Jojo's shoulders in an attempt to reassure the monk. He manages a smile in response as he looks up at you. A single tear manages to slide down his {0} as he says, [say: Thank you, my friend.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.AskJojoForestStory": "You think for a while and decide to ask Jojo how he ended up in the forest.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.AskWhatHappenedNext": "After you've comforted the monk you ask him what he did next.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.BurnedMonasteryFields": "[say: Then, I burned the monastery to the ground and set fire to all the fields... Since that day, I have eked out a meager existence in the wilderness; I study the texts I can, train my body as best I can, and seek to fortify my soul against demonic blandishments. Though I have technically progressed far along my path, with no master and only a pale echo of a fraction of my order's texts at my disposal, I may never be a true master in my own right.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.InsultWimpyVillagers": "Mice... must've been a village of wimps if a few demons could take them out... The monk is obviously distressed... maybe you should comfort him for the moment, if only to make him stop. You put a hand on his silent shoulder...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.JojoAppraisingLook": "He gives you an appraising look before looking away, [say: Until I met you, [name], my only purpose had been to find the demons who destroyed my order and make them pay for the lives they took. That is why I was in the forest, I was in the middle of a harsh training regimen to increase my power and skill so that I may seek out those evil brutes who took everything I loved away from me... but vengeance is not the way of the Celestial Lotus. The Celestial doesn't train bullies or assassins. Finding you and aiding in your quest to protect your village from these demonic creatures of perversion gave me new purpose and would make my departed brothers and sisters proud. I can't honestly say I've given up on having my vengeance but... I will aid you in your quest first if for nothing more than to honor our friendship and honor the memory of the order and its teachings.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.JojoBornThereSilent": "[say: Thank you [name]. I was born there and seeing that...] The monk falls silent again.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.JojoRaisesFinger": "When you open your mouth to speak he raises his hand, asking for a moment with a single{0} finger.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.JojoRecallsTraining": "He looks at you with suddenly tired eyes as he says, [say: Well, I was training in the fields with one of the senior brothers when we saw the monastery was under attack. He sent me to the village to save me since I was a novice. I decided to rally the people there. I figured that I had ran like a coward, I wasn't going to hide like one. It was the village where I was born and a home to many of my brothers and sisters, both figuratively and literally. I ran towards the village with everything I had, hoping to redeem my cowardice by returning with a militia of mice to aid the members of my order.] His voice catches and he looks away, obviously struggling to form words.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.JojoRenewedPeace": "Looking renewed and at peace despite the emotional storm you know must be raging within his tiny frame Jojo thanks you for giving him new purpose.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.JojoSquaredShoulders": "When he answers you his shoulders are squared and his voice has regained some of its former volume, [say: I did what anyone looking at the shattered remains of their life would. I buried them. For the next few days I took the time to lay each and every villager to rest before praying over them all. Then I went back to my monastery, praying with all my heart that they had managed to hold out, at least long enough to escape rather than to be captured and twisted into perverse shells of their former selves. Yet the monastery was another graveyard. I found many bodies there. Some were of the order but there were also countless imps and more than a few demons. The place was defiled with semen and milk reeking of corruption.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.MonkClenchedFists": "You see anger in the monk's eyes as he clenches his fists, [say: They had utterly defiled the monastery and there was nothing I could do about it but honor its memory. I labored for what felt like weeks; burying the fallen; seeking out survivors; gathering what few items of my faith had escaped demonic desecration.] He touches the large beads around his neck meaningfully.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.PlayerImaginesRuin": "That's terrible... you can only imagine what you'd feel like if you returned to Ingnam and saw it destroyed... your family, your friends... You put a hand on the monk's shoulder, intent on comforting him for the moment.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.RubMonkBack": "You try to further console the distressed monk by moving your hand to his back and giving him a few friendly taps. Jojo visibly pulls himself together. [say: Thank you, I'm alright now,] he tells you as he looks up and gives you a weak smile.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.VillageStillStands": "Tough luck... thankfully your village still stands and you doubt any demons would dare attack on your watch... You feel like you should do something for the monk though, so you put a hand on his shoulder, comforting him for the moment.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.VillageStruckFirst": "[say: I was too late. The demons had struck there first, then moved on to my monastery once they were finished. I spent hours searching the streets; every basement, every alley, every attic, every place I could think of where somebody might have hidden. Nothing but ruined buildings, smears of assorted tainted bodily fluids, and the occasional corpse - some demons, many more mice.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkForestConvo.WrapArmsAroundMonk": "Seeing an opportunity, you wrap your arms around the monk as he silently tries to reign in his emotions. Holding him close you can feel the mouse morph's lean muscles as you rub his back 'accidentally' going too low and feeling the base of his tail and the top of his tight little pert ass. As you 'hug' the mouse you make sure he doesn't notice your true intentions and when you release him he actually thanks you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkJoiningTheMonks.AskingWhyMonk": "You decide to ask Jojo why he decided to become a monk in the first place.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkJoiningTheMonks.BigFamilyOfNineteen": "He gives you a warm smile as he speaks, [say: Well I grew up in a big family of 19 so when I was younger I was always the quiet one. I guess I was just introverted but being quiet meant that I didn't always get a lot of attention. It didn't bother me, quite the opposite actually, I enjoyed quiet introspection but with so many brothers and sisters it was next to impossible to get a quiet moment at home.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkJoiningTheMonks.MotherHeldHimClose": "[say: Whenever she found me she would yell for a bit and then hold me close like she'd just watched me dodge a charging rhinoceros. Whenever she asked why I did it I just told her the truth, it was too loud and crowded at home. After a few weeks of this she suggested a compromise. She said I could leave if I had one of my older brothers walk me to the temple and I stayed there where the clergy could see me and keep me safe and fed. Honestly I think my dad came up with the idea, he was always good at compromising and keeping the peace.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkJoiningTheMonks.QuietSmileThenChuckle": "Jojo wears this quiet little smile as he finishes. Then he chuckles and says, [say: Thank you for the memories, [name]. I enjoy our talks.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkJoiningTheMonks.SneakingOutChildhood": "[say: So I would sneak out. My father understood but it drove my mother crazy. Whenever she noticed I had slipped away she would stop everything in the house and take my two oldest brothers to come find me. I never understood why it was such a big deal. We were in a small village near a prestigious monastery, we were safe. Parents let their kids go out and play and run and explore because everyone knew everyone but not my mom. She had to know where you were going, what you were doing and how long until you got back. I would've told her but saying I wanted to explore wasn't a satisfactory answer.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkJoiningTheMonks.TempleBecameImportant": "[say: The temple became very important to me. I read about the world, I spoke to the clergy and I sat and thought. I was enraptured with learning but I didn't want to be a priest, I don't know why... I guess it just didn't appeal to me. When I first saw the monks visiting the temple, it was like dawn breaking. After that I waited until I was old enough to join and made the short pilgrimage to the Monastery of the Celestial Lotus.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.AlreadyMuchBetter": "[say: She's already much better than she was when she got here,] he says with a grin.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.AwkwardSilenceDone": "You tell Jojo that you're actually done. He says, [say: Oh... well that's weird.] and after an awkward silence, the two of you burst out laughing.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.BattleBlowByBlow": "You describe your battle with the Sand Mother in an animated blow by blow and when you get to the end where you raped the Sand Mother you look at Jojo and... lie. You completely gloss over the fact that you sexually assaulted the Sand Mother because despite his interest he is a little naive and offended by the world of sexual conquest. He appraises your actions, ignorant of what actually occurred.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.BattleEndOutcome": "You describe your battle with the Sand Mother in an animated blow by blow. When you get to the end, you tell him about how reasonable she actually was after you beat her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.BetterInOurCare": "[say: She'll fare much better in our care than in the coven's,] he states with conviction.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.ConfusedGlanceBathGirl": "As the question leaves his lips you give Jojo a confused look and, with a glance, direct his gaze toward [bathgirlname].[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.ConfusedSandWitchAllies": "[say: Wait... so you mean to tell me that these sand witches are... allies of Marae? But they're so... sexual.] He seems genuinely confused, but you tell him that sex is part of nature after all, and that there is nothing wrong or shameful about it. He agrees with you, but decries the way the sand witches use their power.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.CumWitchDuty": "You tell Jojo about the cum witch, the herm witch responsible for inseminating the witches there, acting as a father to the others. When you do he scratches his ear, [say: Like I said, I don't get why sex is so overly important to these creatures but whatever, continue.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.FondPraisesCare": "[say: The coven wouldn't have done what you've done for her. You've given her a much, much better life and even aided in fixing her condition, you truly are a champion, [name],] he says, giving you a fond smile and a pat on the back.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.JojoChinHandsThinks": "Jojo reacts by putting his chin in his hands and thinking. [say: Well... I guess that's the human thing to do, especially since she doesn't seem to be corrupted. Maybe these sand witch covens aren't all bad, still hard to believe that they're on our side though...] He looks up and shrugs. [say: Any act of charity though is a good thing. I do hope the poor girl will be alright.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.JojoMarvelsTact": "He marvels at the way you handled the situation. [say: Many would have expected her trying to talk to them to be a trap and hurried to attack her, but not you... That is... incredible, [name], you are truly a great individual.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.JojoShuddersAsks": "He shudders like a child being told a scary story and asks, [say: What did you do?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.JojoSlapsForehead": "He slaps his own forehead and says, [say: Oh... yeah... right.] Obviously embarrassed by not putting two and two together. He smiles good naturedly though, [say: I don't know I guess I just assumed you found some poor mind addled soul and decided to save her.] Jojo says as he looks over at [bathgirlname].[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.JojoTiltsAltercation": "Jojo's head tilts to the side as he says, [say: Maybe the whole thing didn't need to come to an altercation in the first place. A little diplomacy on both sides...]--he gives you a pointed look--[say: might have gone a long way.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.JojoWhistlesBold": "He whistles low, [say: That's a bold move [name]. It seems like they would want that though, it'd allow them to, er, you know... more often, and make more sand witches in the long run wouldn't it?] As the question sound rhetorical you plow on ahead.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.MilkTubSlaveGirl": "You tell Jojo about the poor mind-addled thing you found sitting in a tub of milk, acting as a slave to the sand witch coven.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.RequestMoreWitches": "You tell him how you tried to remedy the current cum witch's situation by asking the Sand Mother to make more cum witches.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.SandMotherConversation": "You tell Jojo about how the Sand Mother spoke with you once you had battled your way to her. You tell him she was reasonable and how the whole thing was, in the end, a simple misunderstanding.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.SandMotherSaysUnfit": "You tell Jojo about how the Sand Mother told you the bath girl was unfit to be free and how they care for her because she can't care for herself.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.SandWitchesCaveFound": "You tell Jojo about your discovery of a cave that served as a base for the sand witches of the desert. You tell him about the whole ordeal, and he listens with wide eyes and jaw agape. When you tell him about meeting the Sand Mother Jojo gasps.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkSandCave.WitchesRoamDesert": "You describe to him how you convinced the Sand Mother to allow her cum witches to roam the desert along with the sand witches and he looks at you with astonishment, [say: You are a generous spirit [name] and this Sand Mother doesn't seem entirely unreasonable.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkVillage.AskingAboutHisVillage": "You decide to ask Jojo about his village.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkVillage.BrightEyesAfterSadness": "Before you can muster a reaction to his sadness, his {0} spread again as he looks up at you with bright eyes.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkVillage.FatherFishermanSilverWhiskers": "[say: My father was a fisherman. He was this calm, strong man with a lot of silver whiskers that always smelled like fish. I remember I used to go out on the boat with him and a few of my brothers and he'd always make sure to pick me up and put me on his shoulders... that is until I got too big. He always made everything look so easy, like the world was just there to shake his hand and make him smile. No one could cook seafood like he did, no one.[pg]Then there was my mother who was a little high strung, but no one could hug you more fiercely or love you more dearly. She was a small woman with a big soul who loved her family more than anything. She was a seamstress before she met my dad and was always the brightest one in the room, which is hard when you have seventeen loud children clamoring for your attention.[pg]Even with 19 people living under one roof my family wasn't the biggest family in town, but there was always plenty work and plenty food. It was a nice simple existence and I am thankful for the time I had with everyone in that village,] he finishes with a serene smile.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkVillage.FondChildhoodReflection": "Looks like Jojo's childhood wasn't so bad. A little sickly sweet and void of wet pussies and drooling dicks, but not bad. You tell him you're happy to have him near you and he smiles for ear to ear, ignorant of your thoughts.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkVillage.RecallingSmallVillage": "He speaks softly with a smile on his face and in his voice, [say: It was a small village near a large beautiful lake. We were peaceful people who laughed and trusted one another, just good simple folk you know?[pg]Most of the people of Belridge were either fishers or farmers with huge families that stayed near the village. There were a few hunters and a few craftsmen. We made enemies of no one and sought to do no harm to others,] Jojo says, his smile fading.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkVillage.ThankingForMemories": "Looks like Jojo's childhood wasn't so bad... you thank the mouse morph monk for sharing his treasured memories with you now that the conversation is over.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.ApothecaryPast": "You tell Jojo that you were an alchemist, and ran the apothecary in your village. He asks questions about your work and how your family felt about you taking up alchemy. You tell him that you left your shop to a friend when you decided to retire and become the next champion.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.BlacksmithTrainingPast": "You tell Jojo about how you spent your time training to become a blacksmith. Not knowing much about smithing he asks questions about the things you learned and you answer them to the best of your ability. To finish you describe the process of fitting armor in great detail and how you were going to start learning advanced techniques but were announced to be the next champion.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.BlacksmithWorkPast": "You tell Jojo about how you spent your time working as a blacksmith. Not knowing much about smithing he asks questions about the things you did and you answer them to the best of your ability. To finish you describe the process of fitting armor in great detail, and tell him that you had a promising apprentice who took over your shop when you became the next champion.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.ChildhoodFightStories": "You tell Jojo about how, growing up, you got into fights a lot. You name names and tell him why and how each of those little brats had got what was coming to them. You tell him how you had planned to join the village guard, but that became a pipe dream when it was announced that you were the next champion.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.DendeHealerAssistant": "You tell Jojo about how you spent a lot of your time at the side of Dende, the village healer. You talk about why you wanted to spend time with the older man as he looked after the sick and infirm and the skills you learned there. You let him know how you had just decided to train to become an official healer when you were announced to be the next champion.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.HelpingCarryThings": "You tell Jojo about how you... helped others carry their things, and clear out old junk from their houses. You mention some of the more interesting items you 'acquired', and tell him how you decided to volunteer as the next champion because life in the village was starting to get dangerous (for you). He seems confused but shrugs it off.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.JojoQuestionsPopularity": "[say: That's nice I guess [name] but didn't you have aspirations beyond being, erm... popular?] he questions.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.JojoSmilesKnowingYou": "Jojo smiles now that he has gotten to know you a little better.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.JojoStrictChildhood": "[pg][say: By Marae, [name], that sounds rough. I had a strict childhood, too, but nothing on that level. I'm certain the pain will pay off, though. I know you can bring Lethice's armies down.]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.KnowledgePassedOn": "You tell Jojo about your insatiable thirst for knowledge and how you spent a lot of time passing on that knowledge to your students. You describe some of the rare books you collected, and mention your disappointment at having to leave them behind when you came here.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.LaughOverFriendsSkill": "You laugh and tell him that you were just really good at making friends, instead of the truth about how much of a slut you actually were.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.LuckyMoneyPast": "You tell Jojo about how you're lucky and you've made quite a bit of money. When the monk asks how, you shrug and tell him it's just plain luck.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Jojoscene.JojoTalkYourOrigin.MissingHistoryPerkBug": "Somehow, you don't seem to have a defined history perk... <b>Please report a bug!</b>[pg]"
